    <briefdescription>
<para>Static utility class for time profiling and logging in ROS2. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides static methods to time code sections, collect and print log messages, and print a formatted report. Uses rclcpp logging macros and supports both immediate and deferred printing. </para>
